ublic","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-12T18:07:20Z","updated_at":"2018-09-12T18:07:20Z","body":"This seems to be caused by the follower not resetting safe_time_to_read correctly.\r\n\r\nWe seem to have been setting safe_time_to_read based on the flushed sst files. Not accounting for the committed entries in rocksdb that haven't been flushed. \r\n\r\nBut, the committed entries are present in the Write Ahead Log and replayed upon restart. The fix is to update the initial safe_time_to_read based on the applied entries from WAL in addition to the flushed files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/420744317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1841896003,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDE4NDE4OTYwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugab